65
00:43:50.000 --> 00:44:22.000
Once you get that sort of fucking ding in your, I figure it's just like having a beer. When are you going to stop? When the pub closes? Or do we buy takeaway to take home in case we're thirsty? When Richard remarked that Philip was asking the same questions as police, the informer sensed his cover was at risk of being blown. To seem less conspicuous, Philip quickly remarked, fuck me dead, maybe I should have been a fucking copper.
