00:44:56.000 --> 00:45:35.000
from him? This comment immediately stood out to the police officers listening in on the discussion, as Paul Anion's physical stature and to the full extent of Gabor Neugebauer's injuries had not yet been released to the public. Richard's remarks were compelling, but were not enough to warrant his arrest, and the undercover sting came to an unsatisfying conclusion. Following the failed sting, Richard Millat told France he was convinced Philip Poglase was working with the police, an assertion that compelled the informer to go into hiding.
