72
00:48:10.000 --> 00:48:50.000
Both men were sentenced to a good behaviour bond and issued with a monetary fine, plus court costs. On October 24, 1994, five months after his arrest, Ivan Millat's committal hearing commenced at Campbelltown local court to determine whether there was enough evidence for the backpacker murder case to proceed to trial. Ivan maintained a relaxed and calm demeanour as Crown Prosecutor Ian Lloyd outlined the case against him, but his opening arguments were cut short when the court was forced to evacuate due to a bomb threat, which was later determined to be a hoax.
这两名男子均被判处守行令，并被处以罚款外加诉讼费。1994年10月24日，在他被捕五个月后，伊万·米拉特的预审听证会在坎贝尔敦地方法院开始，以确定是否有足够的证据将背包客谋杀案交付审判。当皇家检察官伊恩·劳埃德（Ian Lloyd）陈述针对他的案件时，伊万保持着轻松平静的举止，但他的开场陈述在中途被打断，因为法院因炸弹威胁被迫疏散，该威胁后来被证实是虚假的。

